@host = http://localhost:5263

### List ingested documents
GET {{host}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Ask a question (runs the agentic tool-calling loop)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is 250 multiplied by 4?"
}

### Follow-up in the same conversation (paste conversationId from the response above)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Now divide that result by 8.",
  "conversationId": "PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE"
}

### Delete a document (paste an id from the list above)
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/PASTE_DOCUMENT_ID_HERE

### Upload a PDF (set a real path before sending)
POST {{host}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--
